[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/179","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/179/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/179/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/179/events","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/179","id":5396480894,"node_id":"PR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABCyvDjQ","number":179,"title":"✨ GitHub: refresh the issue / PR lists on change with a free conditional request","user":{"login":"td72","id":12109493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12109493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72","html_url":"https://github.com/td72","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10179374926,"node_id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-09T07:37:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T07:42:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/pulls/179","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/179","diff_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/179.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/179.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #177\n\n## What\n\nThe GitHub page's issue and PR lists now keep themselves current without spending API points.\n\n- Every `github-poll-interval` (scaled by the idle / low-quota rules from #168, off with `github-auto-refresh \"off\"`) the page sends **one conditional REST request** for the repository's most recently updated issue or PR: `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues?state=all&sort=updated&direction=desc&per_page=1` with `If-None-Match: <etag>`.\n- A `304 Not Modified` answer costs nothing against the quota (verified with `gh api -i`). Only when the ETag / `updated_at` moves does vig re-fetch both lists and the open issue / PR detail.\n- The first `200` is only a baseline (no refetch); later answers compare against it.\n- Status bar: `lists 12s ago` (age of the lists) and a short green `↻ updated` after a change-driven refresh.\n\n## Fixtures\n\n- `vig fixtures record` now starts from an empty directory so the set is exactly the recording (stale run / log fixtures were piling up), records the change check, and keeps only its status line, `Etag` and body — the other response headers describe the recording account (OAuth scopes, request ids) and must not be checked in.\n- Under `VIG_GH_FIXTURE` replay the check is sent unconditionally, so the single recorded `200` answers every tick.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `change_check_parses_304_and_200` (client): status line / ETag / body parsing.\n- `change_check_baseline_then_change_refetches_lists` (state): baseline → same watermark → moved watermark; only the last one re-fetches and shows the notice.\n\n## Docs\n\nGuide (`views-github`, `config-reference` → `github-poll-interval`) en / ja, README en / ja.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/179/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}]
